# macOS folder-icon file, whose name is literally "Icon" plus a carriage return.
# The bracket below holds that CR byte; this is the form github/gitignore ships
# in Global/macOS.gitignore. Do not "clean up" the line — Icon? would also
# swallow Icons/, Icon1 and anything else five characters long.
Icon[]
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk
*~
.*.swp
.*.swo
.fuse_hidden*
.env*
